{"id":"n65570-1-8","stage":0,"title":"버리다 · 扔","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n65570-1-8-1","ko":"왜 옷들을 밖에 가지고 나오셨어요?","zh":"为什么把衣服拿到外面来了？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么。","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}},{"text":"옷들을","meaning":"衣服，衣裳，服装","explanation":"옷：衣服，衣裳，服装；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"옷","audio":"/audio/4bddf9b9203384c7b240.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30159","senseId":"1","lemma":"옷","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"옷들을","audio":"/audio/0a78bc102684a680d94a.mp3"}},{"text":"밖에","meaning":"外面，外边","explanation":"밖：外面，外边；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"밖","audio":"/audio/c54dd45d274b6e4660ea.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17878","senseId":"4","lemma":"밖","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"밖에","audio":"/audio/b49faf879a59fe63a605.mp3"}},{"text":"가지고","meaning":"拿着","explanation":"가지다：手里拿着或身上带着；가지고 나오다 表示“拿着出来、带出来”。","readings":[{"term":"가지다","audio":"/audio/f3b684d86e5485ededb3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65234","senseId":"1","lemma":"가지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가지고","audio":"/audio/2e847f33430d128ed48a.mp3"}},{"text":"나오셨어요?","meaning":"出，出来","explanation":"나오다：出，出来；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"나오다","audio":"/audio/038a8038eb817ffef26e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62233","senseId":"1","lemma":"나오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나오셨어요","audio":"/audio/7209fe57b347dbf71475.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。",